d #101 against main (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101). The reviewer request didn't save when the PR was created, so I added the code owner as a separate step.\n- **Merge:** The merge was sent to a code owner for approval as policy requires. They approved it (\"Looks right.\"), and #101 is now merged into main.\n\nI couldn't find FIN-212 in the advisory lookup. I relied on the test and the existing docstring, which both say it means banker's rounding.", "type": "text"}]}]}